    "name": "Painkiller (The Mothership)",
    "instructions": "1. Add all of the ingredients except the tonic water to a shaker with crushed ice.\n2. Briefly shake, then pour everything into a double Old Fashioned glass.\n3. Add more crushed ice, then top with chilled tonic water.\n4. Garnish.",
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
